This project
------------

- Maintainer: CLF7758; https://github.com/CLF7758/Prism
- Copyright © 2026 CLF7758, released under GPL-3.0-or-later

Features added in this repository:

- Capture images from the browser through a companion Chrome extension.
- Drag selected items out to other applications (Ctrl+Shift drag).
- Tags with AND filtering and 1-5 star ratings, including batch edits and
  undo.
- Similar image search based on dHash perceptual hashes.
- Batch category moves, deletion and export of the selected images.
- Interactive glTF/GLB 3D model preview in its own window.
- Exposure, channel and tone mapping controls for EXR/HDR sources.
- Extended format support: WebP and SVG through Qt, plus PSD, EXR and HDR
  through an optional OpenImageIO decoder.

See README.md for the current feature status, THIRD_PARTY.md for
the optional dependencies and their licenses, and CHANGELOG.rst for the
project history.
